OL,3,GNEWSAWorkers queue at nearby firm after
OL,4,A600 job cuts
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmployees who lost their jobs at a food
OL,7,Fcompany have been forming a queue to
OL,8,Fget into another nearby firm offering
OL,9,Fwork.
OL,11,FPrimafruit in Evesham hosted a drop-in
OL,12,Fmorning on Friday, after Kanes Foods
OL,13,FLimited went into administration, with
OL,14,Fthe loss of more than 600 jobs.
OL,16,FAbout 12 permanent roles are being
OL,17,Fadvertised and the former said about
OL,18,F100 seasonal jobs were available in the
OL,19,Frun-up to Christmas, with it hoping to
OL,20,Fconvert some of the temporary jobs into
OL,21,Fpermanent ones.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
